201
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:04,800
Xu Liguo !

202
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,480
No...

203
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,960
I won't lose !

204
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:11,610
Ceng Niu,

205
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:15,280
