207
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,160
Soul Splitting !

208
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:24,560
Ruthless Domain !

209
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:33,840
So this is the domain of a peak Soul Formation cultivator...

210
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,200
This Soul Splitting technique...

211
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,720
