234
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:58,520
Sword of Wisdom

235
00:16:00,010 --> 00:16:01,040
Ceng Niu,

236
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,840
I want you to witness

237
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:06,160
