239
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:10,520
Sword of Wisdom,

240
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:11,880
sever !

241
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:18,160
Tie Zhu...

242
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:25,040
Tie Zhu...

243
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:50,640
Enter the world to draw out emotions

244
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:52,760
