277
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,520
I have been enlightened.

278
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:17,440
Thank you for helping me realize

279
00:18:18,210 --> 00:18:20,120
that even a heartless person

280
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:24,080
cannot escape the Life and Death reincarnation cycle.

281
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:49,800
To let go of the consequences of my actions

282
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:51,520
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

283
00:18:51,560 --> 00:18:53,460
like scattered ink.

284
00:18:54,340 --> 00:19:00,940
As destiny falls

285
00:18:57,180 --> 00:19:00,940
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

286
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:08,540
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

287
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:08,540
wither and melt into rivers.

288
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:16,100
Who can deceive

289
00:19:11,740 --> 00:19:16,100
the law of the heavens ?

290
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:19,420
Countless generations

291
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:19,420
have tried before me.

292
00:19:19,710 --> 00:19:23,140
But how could I not catch my dreams

293
00:19:21,540 --> 00:19:23,140
within my warm fingers ?

294
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:27,220
You're at my side when I'm alone

295
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:30,540
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

296
00:19:31,300 --> 00:19:34,500
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

297
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:38,700
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

298
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,700
in the streets.

299
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:43,660
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

300
00:19:40,420 --> 00:19:43,660
Can I break the rules ?

301
00:19:43,670 --> 00:19:46,380
To run towards you !

302
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:49,700
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

303
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:54,340
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

304
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:57,740
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

305
00:19:57,780 --> 00:20:02,420
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

306
00:20:02,870 --> 00:20:08,100
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

307
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:12,020
If your soul is willing to wander,

308
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:16,660
can I still take your hands

309
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:16,660
and hold them tight ?

310
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:19,740
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

311
00:20:19,740 --> 00:20:24,620
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

312
00:20:24,630 --> 00:20:27,900
I dream of destroying

313
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:32,620
the shackles of our fate.

314
00:20:32,620 --> 00:20:36,580
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

315
00:20:36,580 --> 00:20:39,380
You're the hardest to let go of.

316
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:43,260
I want to be with you again

317
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:46,620
so I can look in your eyes.

318
00:20:46,900 --> 00:20:51,860
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
